This repository redistributes normative artefacts that are covered by their own licences. They are located
under specs/, and each folder carries a PROVENANCE.md naming the source, version, retrieval date and licence.

- EN 16931 validation artefacts (Schematron, code lists)
  Source: https://github.com/ConnectingEurope/eInvoicing-EN16931 — Apache License 2.0

- Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 validation artefacts
  Source: https://github.com/OpenPEPPOL/peppol-bis-invoice-3 — Apache License 2.0

- XRechnung Schematron and test suite
  Source: https://github.com/itplr-kosit — Apache License 2.0

- OASIS UBL 2.1 schemas
  Source: https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.1/ — OASIS IPR Policy, redistribution permitted

- UN/CEFACT Cross Industry Invoice (D22B) and CDAR schemas
  Source: https://unece.org/trade/uncefact/xml-schemas — free to use and redistribute

Specifications that may not be redistributed (EN 16931 standard text sold by CEN members, Factur-X
specification documents, AFNOR XP Z12-01x) are NOT included. The relevant PROVENANCE.md explains where to
obtain them.
